            </note>
            <note corresp="#d47-f2" n="2" xml:id="d47-f2-content">
                <p>Dated Feb. 27, <ref target="#pg66">p. 66</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d47-f3" n="3" xml:id="d47-f3-content">
                <p>Maj. Gen. Floyd L. Parks was Director of Information, Office
                    of the Chief of Staff, Department of the Army.</p>
            </note>
